  "title": "Citra: A 3DS Emulator",
  "date": "2025-07-14T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Citra: A 3DS Emulator\n\nCitra VR is a Nintendo 3DS emulator for the Meta Quest, bringing the handheld’s dual-screen, stereoscopic 3D experience into virtual reality.\n\nYou can grab 3D-compatible ROMs from Citra’s official website.\n\nSince most 3DS games were designed with dual-eye 3D in mind, they feel perfectly at home in VR — almost like they were made for it.",
